<p id="S3.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">ppl refers to perplexity (lower is better) and acc refers to accuracy (higher is better).</span></p>
