<section id="S3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S3.SS2.6" class="ltx_text">III-B</span> </span><span id="S3.SS2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Results</span></h3>

<div id="S3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S3.T1" title="TABLE I ‣ III-A4 Parameters ‣ III-A Experiments Setup ‣ III Experiments ‣ SLaB: Sparse-Lowrank-Binary Decomposition for Efficient Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">I</span></a> presents perplexity on the WikiText-2 dataset and average accuracies on zero-shot tasks for SLaB and baselines. Using <math id="S3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="50\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50\%</annotation></semantics></math> compression ratio for the Llama-3.2 1B model, SLaB reduces perplexity by <math id="S3.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="36.04\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>36.04</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">36.04\%</annotation></semantics></math> and improves accuracy by <math id="S3.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8.98\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>8.98</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8.98\%</annotation></semantics></math> compared to the best-performing baseline.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S3.SS3.6" class="ltx_text">III-C</span> </span><span id="S3.SS3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Hyperparameter Exploration</span></h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S3.T2" title="TABLE II ‣ III-C Hyperparameter Exploration ‣ III Experiments ‣ SLaB: Sparse-Lowrank-Binary Decomposition for Efficient Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">II</span></a> presents the impact of the comparison group size and the number of iterations on the results.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE II: </span>Hyperparameter exploration with Llama-2 7B (<math id="S3.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{CR}=50\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{CR}=50\%</annotation></semantics></math>) model.</figcaption>
<table id="S3.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S3.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:5.7pt;padding-right:5.7pt;"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Comparison</span></td>
